# Catalogue-Viewer (MNS-Traders)

This repo is a **mobile-first e-commerce catalogue** for MNS-Traders, being **redesigned in Next.js** (App Router). Treat it as a **Vite → Next migration**, not a greenfield product.

## Source of truth

- **Behavior, backend, and navigation:** `D:\MNS_Traders\CatalogueViewerMNS` (Vite + React Router).
- **UI look:** modernize in this Next app; do not invent new business flows unless asked.
- Read the Vite app before changing routing, auth, cart, orders, catalog filters, or admin.

## Preserve these shop routes

| Path | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `/` | Product catalogue |
| `/cart` | Cart |
| `/order` | Order form |

## Preserve these admin routes

| Path | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `/admin/login` | Admin login |
| `/admin` and `/admin/dashboard` | Protected dashboard |
| `/admin/categories` | Manage categories |
| `/admin/products` | Manage products |
| `/admin/orders` | Manage orders |

Admin pages (except login) must stay behind auth, matching Vite `ProtectedRoute`.

## Implementation notes

- Keep shop and admin as separate App Router trees (`app/(shop)` vs `app/admin`).
- Reuse existing backend: Supabase, email, and storage patterns from the Vite app.
- Design for mobile first (filters, product detail sheets, cart, checkout).
- Do not copy Vite logging noise or `react-router-dom`; use Next navigation APIs from current Next docs in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`.
